<div id="breadcrumbs-overview">
    <h1>Breadcrumbs Component</h1>
    
    <p>
        Breadcrumbs are a navigational landmark that let the user discover their current position in the site hierarchy and provide a means to navigate upwards through that hierarchy.
    </p>
    <p>
        Typically, the last breadcrumb is the current page, therefore that link's href attribute is not relevant and can be removed.
    </p>
</div>
